    "summary": "The user expresses profound caregiver burnout and nihilistic ideation, contemplating whether \"stopping\" everything would be more merciful than the current slow pain. The assistant responds by validating the user's emotional exhaustion and the logic of their desire for peace, while repeatedly providing crisis helpline information.",
